WEBVTT

1
00:00:11.007 --> 00:00:25.483
"Peter!" Benjamin called.

2
00:00:25.484 --> 00:00:28.648
"Let's fly my kite today."

3
00:00:28.649 --> 00:00:33.866
Peter shook his head.

4
00:00:33.867 --> 00:00:36.470
"It's Laundry Day.

5
00:00:36.471 --> 00:00:39.188
I have a bag of dirty clothes.

6
00:00:39.189 --> 00:00:44.061
Mrs. Tiggywinkle is going to wash them."

7
00:00:44.062 --> 00:00:47.532
"I will help you with the bag," Benjamin said.

8
00:00:47.533 --> 00:00:49.754
"Then we can play."

9
00:00:49.755 --> 00:01:02.511
Peter grinned. "Let's go!"

10
00:01:02.512 --> 00:01:06.557
The bunnies pulled the bag along the road.

11
00:01:06.558 --> 00:01:17.157
They dragged it up a hill.

12
00:01:17.158 --> 00:01:19.695
They dropped it in a puddle.

13
00:01:19.696 --> 00:01:22.121
"Oops," Peter said.

14
00:01:22.122 --> 00:01:31.116
"Now the laundry is really dirty!"

15
00:01:31.117 --> 00:01:38.868
The bunnies got to Mrs. Tiggywinkle's house.

16
00:01:38.869 --> 00:01:41.933
"Wow," Peter said.

17
00:01:41.934 --> 00:01:47.902
"This is a lot of laundry!" Benjamin said.

18
00:01:47.903 --> 00:01:53.049
Mrs. Tiggywinkle was very tired.

19
00:01:53.050 --> 00:01:56.779
She looked at Peter's bag.

20
00:01:56.780 --> 00:01:58.952
"Ugh," she said.

21
00:01:58.953 --> 00:02:01.835
"These clothes are a mess!"

22
00:02:01.836 --> 00:02:04.742
"Sorry," Peter said.

23
00:02:04.743 --> 00:02:09.193
"The clothes were already dirty," Benjamin said.

24
00:02:09.194 --> 00:02:11.877
Mrs. Tiggywinkle frowned.

25
00:02:11.878 --> 00:02:15.260
"Careless bunnies!" she said.

26
00:02:15.261 --> 00:02:18.845
Mrs. Tiggywinkle took off her apron.

27
00:02:18.846 --> 00:02:23.072
"I am too tired to work today," she said.

28
00:02:23.073 --> 00:02:25.373
"I need a holiday!"

29
00:02:25.374 --> 00:02:34.680
Then she dashed out the door.
